# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: chua duoc khai bao
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# Bien module KHONG duoc nhin thay trong ham neu thieu `global`.
#
# `k` duoc khai `k: "i32" = 5` o cap module nen no la bien THAT - nhung ham
# phai khai `global k` de thay no. Khong co `global`, bien do khong ton tai
# trong khung cua ham.
#
# Day la thu tu CO CHU DICH, khong phai "con can lam": khung bien cua ham la
# pham vi rieng, va `global` la cach noi giang giua hai pham vi do. Neu bo
# yeu cau nay, chinh compiler se do lai mot bien module co gia tri 0 nham -
# dung loai loi am tham ma du an tranh.
k: "i32" = 5

def uses_k() -> "i32":
    return k
